    </view>
  </view>

  <view class="entry fade-up" bindtap="goMeihua" hover-class="entry-hover">
    <view class="entry-ico">☯</view>
    <view class="entry-main">
      <view class="entry-name">梅花易数</view>
      <view class="entry-desc">以数起卦，观本·互·变三卦，体用生克断其趋，依《周易》卦象义理。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="entry-arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="entry fade-up" bindtap="goXlr" hover-class="entry-hover">
    <view class="entry-ico">☰</view>
    <view class="entry-main">
      <view class="entry-name">小六壬</view>
      <view class="entry-desc">九宫真传，月上起日、日上起时，掐指三传知前中后之脉络。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="entry-arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="entry fade-up" bindtap="goHistory" hover-class="entry-hover">
    <view class="entry-ico">☷</view>
    <view class="entry-main">
      <view class="entry-name">卦例历史</view>
      <view class="entry-desc">云端存档每一次起卦起课（仅本人可见），随时回看复盘。</view>
    </view>
    <view class="entry-arrow">›</view>
  </view>

  <view class="card fade-up">
    <view class="section-title">说明</view>
    <view class="hint">本程序依据《周易》卦象义理与民间象数之法设算，属传统文化研习与趣味推演，不构成任何现实决策、投资、医疗或人生建议。古人云“不动不占”，心无实所问，则不必起；起而有疑，当以明理为先。</view>
  </view>

  <view class="disclaimer fade-up">仅供娱乐 · 无迷信成分 · 切勿当真决策</view>
</view>
